{##
 # Legacy XML Import error log
 #
 # I'm not really anticipating we get here very often (if at all)
 # since the legacy quiz sml only had so much variation; however,
 # Learnosity introduces a whole new category of problems we haven't
 # enconutered/solved yet.
 #
 # @param IAssessable $assessment  The assessment instance we spawned
 # @param array $errors            A list of error messages spawned during xml import
 #}
<div class="row">
    <div class="small-12 island">
        <h1>XML Import Errors</h1>

        <section class="content">
            <p>We encountered the following issues during xml import:</p>

            <ul>
                {% for error in errors %}
                    <li>{{ error }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
